    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτοπ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>being out of the way,</i> hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>absurdity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1372
			</span></i>; of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				349
			</span></i>; <i>singularity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				215a
			</span></i>; of sounds or words, <i>uncouthness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>extraordinary nature,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοσήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.51
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν τιμωριῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.82
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πάθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					251d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>logical absurdity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.240
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>wickedness, misdeed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ju.</u>
				11.11
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Vit.</u>
				p.34J.
			</span></i></div>
